  "translation": "Na olgeta Yisrael i lukim olsem king i no harim ol, na ol manmeri i bin tokim ⟨את⟩ king wanpela tok, i tok olsem: Wanem hap bilong mipela i stap long David? Em i no gat hanua bilong mipela long pikinini bilong Yishai. Go long ol haus sel bilong yu, Yisrael! Na nau, lukim ⟨את⟩ haus bilong yu yet, David! Na Yisrael i go long ol haus sel bilong en.",
